      "t": "Thinking the visitors are ordinary guests, Lyova stays in character inside Chef Barinov's office and barks at them not to disturb him. To his horror, the men turn out to be debt collectors who believe Lyova is the head chef and demand a hundred thousand by tomorrow.",
